"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1311319005":{"text":"告诉我发生了什么？公主殿下她……她……你们告诉我啊，到底怎么了！","source_cn":"告诉我发生了什么？公主殿下她……她……你们告诉我啊，到底怎么了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4BF317B53ACF659","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311319008:0":{"text":"……你们是说公主殿下一年前真的病逝了？她不是得到艾雅的神恩才活过来，而是恶魔在她的体内，假扮成她复活？","source_cn":"……你们是说公主殿下一年前真的病逝了？她不是得到艾雅的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD33C5FFC278B9829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311319009:0":{"text":"艾雅的神恩？原来大公是这样告诉你的吗？","source_cn":"艾雅的神恩？原来大公是这样告诉你的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90972001889D316E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311319010:0":{"text":"那时候我们都以为殿下过世了，整个城堡里都弥漫着悲伤。可她去世后的第三天，大公突然喜出望外地告诉我们，因为我们的虔诚，神明降下恩典，让公主殿下复活了……","source_cn":"那时候我们都以为殿下过世了，整个城堡里都弥漫着悲伤。可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F0E3B5210C1FA7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311319011:0":{"text":"我们亲眼看到殿下从小礼拜堂里走出来，和以往一模一样……可没想、没想到这竟然是恶魔的诡计？！","source_cn":"我们亲眼看到殿下从小礼拜堂里走出来，和以往一模一样……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A412EEE2050522B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docu